{
  "name": "blast-detonation-sequence-ui",
  "description": "Visual verification of detonation sequence UI: auto-sequence, delay labels, color coding",
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "new_game seed:42",
      "timeout": 10,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "new_game seed:42"
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 50000,
          "holeCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan grid rows:3 cols:3 spacing:5 depth:6 start:15,15",
      "description": "Two increment clicks on the spacing stepper (data-field=\"spacing\") raise it 3->5m (DEFAULT_SPACING_M, Drill.ts) before dragging, so the (15,15)-(25,25) rectangle computes the declared 3x3 instead of the default-spacing 4x4 (issue #479 follow-up, Finding #4).",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"blast\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"grid-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"spacing\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"spacing\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "dragTiles",
          "x1": 15,
          "z1": 15,
          "x2": 25,
          "z2": 25
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "holeCount": 9
        },
        "note": "3 rows x 3 cols = 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:* explosive:boomite amount:5 stemming:2",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"charge-all\"]"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 9
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "sequence auto delay_step:50",
      "description": "Real bug found converting this step: role:player + clicking auto-sequence directly looked converted, but with no stepper clicks first the panel's dstepMs stays at its 25ms default -- sequencedCount alone can't catch a wrong delay value, since Auto Sequence assigns every hole a delay regardless of what it is. Sequence's delay-step stepper now carries data-field=\"delay-step\" (Sequence.ts) so a click can target it unambiguously. 5 increment clicks: 25ms default -> 50 (DELAY_STEP_INCREMENT=5ms).",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-step=\"3\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"delay-step\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"delay-step\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"delay-step\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"delay-step\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"delay-step\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"delay-step\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"auto-sequence\"]"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "sequencedCount": 9
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "sequence set hole:H1 delay:0",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H1\"] [data-action=\"delay-dec\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Per-hole delay is a relative +/- stepper ([data-hole=\"<id>\"] [data-action=\"delay-inc\"/\"delay-dec\"], Sequence.ts), stepping by the panel's current delay-step value and clamping at 0. Reaching an exact target is therefore arithmetic on the delay Auto Sequence actually assigned, read out of a real command-mode trace (screenshots/scenario-<name>-command/step-NN-sequence.json's sequenceDelays) rather than computed by re-deriving autoVPattern. This file drove the delay step to 50ms before Auto Sequence, and Auto Sequence left H1 at 50ms (traced: step-03-sequence.json), so one decrement lands exactly on the declared 0.",
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "sequencedCount": 9
        },
        "note": "H1 50ms -> 0 at a 50ms step"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "sequence set hole:H5 delay:200",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H5\"] [data-action=\"delay-inc\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "H5 came out of Auto Sequence on 150ms (traced: step-03-sequence.json); one increment at the 50ms step reaches the declared 200.",
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "sequencedCount": 9
        },
        "note": "H5 150ms -> 200"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "sequence set hole:H9 delay:500",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H9\"] [data-action=\"delay-inc\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole=\"H9\"] [data-action=\"delay-inc\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "H9 is Auto Sequence's last hole at 400ms (traced: step-03-sequence.json); 2 increments at the 50ms step reach the declared 500.",
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "sequencedCount": 9
        },
        "note": "H9 400ms -> 450 -> 500"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "sequence show",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "sequence show"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    }
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "overview",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 45
    },
    {
      "name": "closeup",
      "yaw": 90,
      "pitch": 10
    },
    {
      "name": "birdseye",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 80
    }
  ]
}
